{"unit_id":"clclyzybzjsq__dsh-btw#card-zh","repo":"clclyzybzjsq/dsh-btw","commit":"c5414c074aa334ac0ba101473cbf08db91862437","type":"card","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:26","src/index.ts:83","src/index.ts:116","src/index.ts:151"],"text":"dsh-btw 是面向 DSH 的全局命令插件：在任意 agent 会话中输入 /btw 即可发起一次不写入会话记忆的一次性问答。它通过 commands 服务注册 detached 命令，并调用 llm 服务单独请求模型；会话最近最多 40 条用户和助手文本会作为只读背景，字符总量限制为 32000。插件优先沿用会话最近一次请求的 provider 和 model，缺少路由时尝试 agent 配置；回答以命令结果呈现，空问题、模型错误和无文本结果会返回错误。适合想临时追问而不把问答加入后续会话上下文的 DSH 用户，不需要单独配置密钥或账号。"}
{"unit_id":"clclyzybzjsq__dsh-btw#card-en","repo":"clclyzybzjsq/dsh-btw","commit":"c5414c074aa334ac0ba101473cbf08db91862437","type":"card","lang":"en","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:26","src/index.ts:83","src/index.ts:116","src/index.ts:151"],"text":"dsh-btw adds a global /btw command for one-off DSH questions. It runs a detached model request without adding the exchange to session memory. Recent messages may serve as read-only context. It reuses the current model route or agent settings and reports routing or model errors."}
